  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The branch you cut supplied the second line of a ground message.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The Copper Heron is",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "quasi"
 },
 {
  "key": "The Copper Heron is {0} of here, beyond the ministry lane.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "template"
 },
 {
  "key": "The cut feed ends",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "quasi"
 },
 {
  "key": "The cut feed ends {0} of here, at the south edge of the square — look for the old connector block between the paving grooves.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "template"
 },
 {
  "key": "The duplicate is a clerical ghost. The oil is not: it was bought on the same seat. Eda's stall, west past the clock.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The first forty-three was issued to VELEZ, M. The second printed on the same seat, so the terminal filed it as a duplicate.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The lamp is out. The wick is still warm.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The letters burn down before four. At first light Lev finds Butch still in the square and walks him up the old service path.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The lower row is dark. The cut ends are beside it, exactly where they were at dusk.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The market is",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "quasi"
 },
 {
  "key": "The market is {0} of here. Eda sells lamp oil under the blue canvas.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "template"
 },
 {
  "key": "The next train is in the morning. Nothing useful happens before morning.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The night service calls back at seven tomorrow. Be on the platform.",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "THE NIGHT SERVICE LEAVES ECHO CITY",
  "files": [
   "src/cars/presentCity3d/chapter3OpeningContent.js"
  ],
  "kind": "literal"
 },
 {
  "key": "The overlap is almost a hand width. Pressing one end into the old clamp would restore contact without a splice.",
